
# Book Reading List Application

## About
A simple web application to manage a personal book reading list.

## Features
- Add a book title and author name.
- Mark books as read or unread.
- Remove books from the list.
- View the total number of books.

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## How to Run
1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open `index.html` in a web browser.
3. Add books and manage your reading list.

